      ],
      "message": "txorphanage: hand reconsideration over when its announcement is erased\n\nA child that arrives before its parent is kept as an orphan. Once the\nparent is accepted on its own, the orphan is put in one randomly chosen\nannouncer's work set to be retried. If that announcer disconnects or is\nevicted first, the orphan is never retried, and re-announcements by the\nother announcers don't fetch it again since it is already held. This\nkeeps e.g. a CPFP child of a parent that pays for itself out of the\nmempool until the orphan is evicted, and an announcer can cause it on\npurpose.\n\nHand reconsideration over to the remaining announcer with the lowest\nNodeId instead.\n\nRemove its hole from the liveness target.",
